§ ARCHITECTURE-NOTES-APPLIED
  SMT-LIB2 over C-FFI         ← portability + audit-trail + version-looseness
                                (handoff-recommended + our-decision)
  Tempfile-transport          ← simpler than pipe-management ; reproduction-
                                friendly ; overhead negligible vs solve-time
  Sorted-key canonical-emit   ← cache-determinism-REQUIRED ;
                                CASE-7 selftest-proven
  SHA-256 content-addr        ← Odin-core-available ; universal-tooling ;
                                universal-verifier-semantics
  Sharded-cache-layout        ← NTFS-scale friendly ; git-object-style
  Ed25519 JSONL chain         ← deterministic-sig + independent-entry-verify +
                                Odin-core-available + small-keys + fast
  Dual-source obligation-collect ← T20 refine-queue (per-unification)
                                   + T21 IR-walk (module-wide)
  Lazy-batch discharge         ← handoff-recommended ∵ cache-friendliness
                                (vs eager-per-site)
  UF-encoding morphemes        ← CSLv3-morphemes-semantic-not-arithmetic ;
                                UF-predicates-reason-structurally
  Stack-composition via f_and  ← conjunction-of-predicates ; trivial-true
                                (s/g) filtered-to-keep-scripts-lean
  Graceful-degrade no-solver   ← handoff §WHEN-STUCK pre-authorized ;
                                Skipped result class ; tests auto-skip

